{% comment %}
  FUEL_04 collection grid offer card. One cell in the product grid, dropped in
  at the position the block is given, on the same seam the theme's own
  quiz-promo-card uses, so the grid keeps its own column and row rules and
  nothing about the surrounding cards changes.

  The brief asks for "the same placement style as the promotional cards
  currently being tested", and that is snippets/quiz-promo-card.liquid: a
  photograph behind a dark gradient, rounded corners, a shadow. Frames
  127:126079, 127:126253 and 127:126350 draw the same treatment with the copy
  centred, two banded translucent tier rows and a button across the foot, and
  that is what is built here.

  Two ways in. The grid section renders it on its own after every Nth product,
  passing section_settings and a design number, 1 to 3, which picks one of the
  three drawn cards (photograph, band position, button face); those cards show
  on every screen. A fuel04_offer_card block renders it too, pinned at one
  spot, and then everything comes from the block, its screen included. Every
  string is the frame's own.

  The snippet owns its <li>, exactly like snippets/quiz-promo-card.liquid, and
  ships hidden. assets/fuel04-multibuy.css reveals it behind the variant class,
  and in the theme editor so it can be found and configured.

  The stylesheet is NOT emitted here. facets.js replaces #ProductGridContainer's
  innerHTML on every filter and sort and a tag inserted through innerHTML never
  runs, so every FUEL_04 asset loads once from the head, in
  snippets/fuel04-global.liquid.

  Messaging only, no cart or discount mechanics.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} a fuel04_offer_card block (one of block or section_settings)
  - section_settings: {Object} the grid section's settings (one of block or
    section_settings)
  - design: {Number} 1, 2 or 3, which drawn card to show when rendered from
    section_settings (optional, 1)
  - product_position: {Number} the grid position the card is standing in, used
    for the theme's own reveal-on-scroll ordering (optional)
{% endcomment %}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'sv' -%}
  {%- liquid
    comment
      The card is one big link, so it always needs somewhere to go. An empty
      URL setting used to drop the href and leave an anchor that looks like a
      button and does nothing, so the setting falls back to the all products
      collection instead. routes.* is used for the fallback so it carries the
      market prefix on its own.
    endcomment
    if block
      assign fuel04_card_url = block.settings.url

      comment
        Which screen a pinned card is for. A pinned card sits in one cell, and
        the grid runs four columns on a wide screen and two on a phone, so it is
        placed per device the way the UGC tiles in this same section are, and
        assets/fuel04-multibuy.css takes it out on the other screen. Defaulted
        rather than required, so a block saved before this setting existed
        still draws somewhere.
      endcomment
      assign fuel04_device = block.settings.device | default: 'desktop'
      assign fuel04_photo = block.settings.photo | default: '1'
      assign fuel04_tiers = block.settings.tiers_position | default: 'middle'
      assign fuel04_button = block.settings.button_style | default: 'dark'
      assign fuel04_image = block.settings.image
      assign fuel04_heading = block.settings.heading
      assign fuel04_sub_text = block.settings.sub_text
      assign fuel04_tier_1_count = block.settings.tier_1_count
      assign fuel04_tier_1_text = block.settings.tier_1_text
      assign fuel04_tier_2_count = block.settings.tier_2_count
      assign fuel04_tier_2_text = block.settings.tier_2_text
      assign fuel04_cta_text = block.settings.cta_text
    else
      assign fuel04_card_url = section_settings.fuel04_card_url

      comment
        A repeating card shows on every screen, so no device class. The design
        number picks one of the three drawn cards: 127:126079 bands at the
        foot with a light button, 127:126253 and 127:126350 bands at the top
        with a dark button, each on its own photograph.
      endcomment
      assign fuel04_device = 'all'
      case design
        when 2
          assign fuel04_photo = '2'
          assign fuel04_tiers = 'top'
          assign fuel04_button = 'dark'
        when 3
          assign fuel04_photo = '3'
          assign fuel04_tiers = 'top'
          assign fuel04_button = 'dark'
        else
          assign fuel04_photo = '1'
          assign fuel04_tiers = 'bottom'
          assign fuel04_button = 'light'
      endcase
      assign fuel04_image = section_settings.fuel04_card_image
      assign fuel04_heading = section_settings.fuel04_card_heading
      assign fuel04_sub_text = section_settings.fuel04_card_sub_text
      assign fuel04_tier_1_count = section_settings.fuel04_card_tier_1_count
      assign fuel04_tier_1_text = section_settings.fuel04_card_tier_1_text
      assign fuel04_tier_2_count = section_settings.fuel04_card_tier_2_count
      assign fuel04_tier_2_text = section_settings.fuel04_card_tier_2_text
      assign fuel04_cta_text = section_settings.fuel04_card_cta_text
    endif

    if fuel04_card_url == blank
      assign fuel04_card_url = routes.all_products_collection_url
    endif

    comment
      The photograph. Each of the three cards carries its own, shipped as a
      theme asset because the frames are the source and nothing in the admin
      holds them. A merchant picked image still wins.
    endcomment
    assign fuel04_photo_asset = 'fuel04-card-' | append: fuel04_photo | append: '.jpg'
    case fuel04_photo
      when '2'
        assign fuel04_photo_h = 785
      when '3'
        assign fuel04_photo_h = 746
      else
        assign fuel04_photo_h = 1001
    endcase
  -%}
  <li
    {% if block %}{{ block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}
    class="grid__item fuel04 fuel04-card fuel04-card--{{ fuel04_device }} fuel04-card--tiers-{{ fuel04_tiers }}{% if fuel04_button == 'light' %} fuel04-card--cta-light{% endif %}{% if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll %} scroll-trigger animate--slide-in{% endif %}"
    {% if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll %}
      data-cascade
      style="display: none; --animation-order: {{ product_position }};"
    {% else %}
      style="display: none;"
    {% endif %}>
    <a class="fuel04-card__inner" href="{{ fuel04_card_url }}">
      {%- comment -%}
        The picture behind the card. A merchant picked image wins; with none
        picked the card still gets the photograph the frame draws, shipped as a
        theme asset, rather than falling back to a flat colour the design does
        not have. Decorative either way: the heading below carries the meaning.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if fuel04_image != blank -%}
        {{
          fuel04_image
          | image_url: width: 700
          | image_tag:
            class: 'fuel04-card__media',
            loading: 'lazy',
            widths: '350, 550, 700',
            sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 25vw, 50vw',
            alt: ''
        }}
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          class="fuel04-card__media"
          src="{{ fuel04_photo_asset | asset_url }}"
          width="560"
          height="{{ fuel04_photo_h }}"
          loading="lazy"
          alt="">
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="fuel04-card__head">
        {%- if fuel04_heading != blank -%}
          <span class="fuel04-card__heading">{{ fuel04_heading }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if fuel04_sub_text != blank -%}
          <span class="fuel04-card__sub">{{ fuel04_sub_text }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
      <span class="fuel04-card__tiers">
        {%- if fuel04_tier_1_text != blank -%}
          <span class="fuel04-card__tier">
            {%- if fuel04_tier_1_count != blank -%}
              <span class="fuel04-card__tier-count">{{ fuel04_tier_1_count }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="fuel04-card__tier-text">{{ fuel04_tier_1_text }}</span>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if fuel04_tier_2_text != blank -%}
          <span class="fuel04-card__tier">
            {%- if fuel04_tier_2_count != blank -%}
              <span class="fuel04-card__tier-count">{{ fuel04_tier_2_count }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="fuel04-card__tier-text">{{ fuel04_tier_2_text }}</span>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
      {%- if fuel04_cta_text != blank -%}
        <span class="fuel04-card__cta">{{ fuel04_cta_text }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>
  </li>
{%- endif -%}
